      "text": "In the New Testament the mustard mentioned is the common mustard (Sinapis nigra), which in Palestine will grow to the height of 10 feet or more. The birds that “lodge in the branches” (Matt. 13:31; Mark 4:32; Luke 13:19) frequent the plant for the sake of the seeds.",
